[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10920.309, "timestamp": "03:02:00", "text": "大学附近的新房"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10922.07, "timestamp": "03:02:02", "text": "有时候价格便宜得多。是的，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10925.75, "timestamp": "03:02:05", "text": "真的。是的，我也是这么想的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10928.07, "timestamp": "03:02:08", "text": "如果那样的话，对我来说就更适用了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10930.389, "timestamp": "03:02:10", "text": "可能的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10932.63, "timestamp": "03:02:12", "text": "是的。 6点以后搬出宿舍就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10935.15, "timestamp": "03:02:15", "text": "几个月。谁在乎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10938.87, "timestamp": "03:02:18", "text": "嗯。是的。而我拥有的其中一件事就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10941.75, "timestamp": "03:02:21", "text": "比如，当我在日本的时候……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10944.469, "timestamp": "03:02:24", "text": "我去那里，把一切都弄清楚了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10947.99, "timestamp": "03:02:27", "text": "七月的前两周我必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10951.51, "timestamp": "03:02:31", "text": "一旦我找到兼职工作，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10954.07, "timestamp": "03:02:34", "text": "必须像……呃……资金，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10957.91, "timestamp": "03:02:37", "text": "需要更多地管理它，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10961.11, "timestamp": "03:02:41", "text": "研究经费和研究"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10964.11, "timestamp": "03:02:44", "text": "以及那玩意儿，供个人使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10967.67, "timestamp": "03:02:47", "text": "再加上现在我感觉就像拥有了这一切"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10968.372, "timestamp": "03:02:48", "author": "@adthirnegii555", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/2Cc1YwU-uCrqW2z5qvi5AkqQE1B24SRxdmfPyDze9eyV1Sux1rRBrAOLxTFmE3GC3YMqYbZsL6k=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hello"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10971.51, "timestamp": "03:02:51", "text": "这个跟模型负担有关的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10975.51, "timestamp": "03:02:55", "text": "嗯，所以我就想，我得腾出2000美元。"}]